<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Chocolate 6-mth net down 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Chocolate 6-mth net down 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  8.62    vs	11.43</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)	2.4     vs	 5.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		  200.32    vs     109.26</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   16.37    vs	16.51</p>
<p>    Minorities	  less  4.63    vs less  1.21</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Chocolate Products (Malaysia) Bhd. The company is involved in the manufacture and sale of confectionaries in Malaysia.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-23 8911)</p>
</text>
